<section class="exam-session" aria-labelledby="exam-session-title">
<header class="exam-session-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow"><%= exam.mode==='formal' ? 'FORMAL TEST' : 'PRACTICE' %></p><h1 id="exam-session-title"><%= exam.mode==='formal' ? '正式模擬測驗' : '練習測驗' %></h1></div><p><%- icon('clock') %><span>開始時間 <%= formatDate(exam.started_at) %></span></p></header>
<p class="form-note">離開此測驗頁面將自動交卷；已答題照常計分，未答題以答錯計。重新整理會保留原卷、答案與計時，切換分頁不影響作答。</p>
<form action="/exams/submit" method="POST" data-exam-form data-exam-sequence="<%= sequence %>"><input type="hidden" name="_token" value="<%= csrf %>"><input type="hidden" name="_exam" value="<%= exam.nonce %>"><input type="hidden" name="_page" value="<%= page %>">
<div class="exam-columns"><div class="exam-question-list">
<% for(const question of questions) { %><article class="question-block" id="exam-question-<%= question.position %>" data-exam-question="<%= question.position %>">
<h2><span>QUESTION</span> <%= String(question.position).padStart(2,'0') %><small>/ <%= questions.length %></small></h2><p class="form-note"><%= question.bank_name %></p><div class="question-content preserve-whitespace"><%- question.question %></div>
<% for(const option of options) { %><label class="answer-option" for="<%= option %>_<%= question.position %>"><input type="radio" name="Q<%= question.position %>" value="<%= option %>" id="<%= option %>_<%= question.position %>" <%= answers['Q'+question.position]===option ? 'checked' : '' %>><span class="option-letter"><%= option %></span><span class="option-content preserve-whitespace"><%- question[option] %></span></label><% } %></article><% } %>
</div><aside class="exam-navigation" id="exam-navigation" aria-labelledby="exam-navigation-title"><div class="exam-navigation-heading"><h2 id="exam-navigation-title">作答進度</h2><span data-exam-count aria-live="polite" hidden>0 / <%= questions.length %></span></div><p class="form-note" data-exam-save-status role="status" aria-live="polite">作答內容會自動保存。</p><progress data-exam-progress max="<%= questions.length %>" value="0" aria-label="已作答題數" hidden></progress><nav class="exam-number-grid" aria-label="前往測驗題目"><% for(const question of questions) { %><a href="#exam-question-<%= question.position %>" data-exam-link="<%= question.position %>" aria-label="第 <%= question.position %> 題"><%= question.position %></a><% } %></nav><p>點選題號跳至題目。<span class="answered-key" data-exam-key hidden>藍色代表已作答。</span></p><a class="text-link" href="#exam-submit">前往繳交 <%- icon('arrow') %></a></aside></div>
<div class="submit-bar" id="exam-submit"><p>繳交前，記得再確認一次是否有未作答的題目。</p><button class="button" type="submit">繳交考卷 <%- icon('arrow') %></button></div></form></section>
